      <description>&lt;p&gt;Pumpkin bread with chocolate chips is probably my favorite seasonal food. Katja endorses the making of pumpkin bread. I took opportunity of Becky being out of town to make a double batch. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Katja still has a little dificulty saying pumpkin but she manages and has known the word for about four months. Too boot, she has liked muffins since Nigeria when Blessing would make them for us.  So i got some silicone muffin cups to make muffins with Katja. As it happened this time she expired before i could make them and she woke up the next morning to a mountain of pumpkin bread. &lt;/p&gt;
